      "review.claude.faq4.answer": "No, Claude cannot generate images. Unlike ChatGPT (which has DALL-E) or Gemini (which has Imagen), Claude is purely a text-based AI. However, it can analyze and describe images you upload, and can create SVGs and code-based visualizations through Artifacts.",
